<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Hyundai Motor Service H1 net drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hyundai Motor Service H1 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billions of won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)		   322	vs     2,010</p>
<p>    Net			  4.64	vs     24.17</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	4.64	vs     37.09</p>
<p>    Turnover	     2,715.03	vs  2,948.82</p>
<p>Note - Hyundai Motor Service Co Ltd is an affiliate of the Hyundai Group. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
</text>
